---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How Suggestions Blog handles information about visitors." >
  <div class="wrap page prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated 18 November 2026</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>This is a static website. We do not ask you to create an account and we do not set cookies ourselves. Fonts are served from this site, not from Google.</p>
    <h2>Newsletter</h2>
    <p>If you subscribe, your email address is processed by our email provider so we can send the newsletter. We use it only for that purpose and you can unsubscribe in any email. We will name the provider here when the sign-up is switched on.</p>
    <h2>Hosting and logs</h2>
    <p>Our hosting provider may keep standard server logs (such as IP address and pages requested) for security and reliability.</p>
    <h2>Free tools</h2>
    <p>Some tools under <a href="/tools/">Free tools</a> fetch data from third-party services when you use them. For example, the currency converter requests exchange rates from exchangerate-api.com, which can see your IP address. Other tools run entirely in your browser.</p>
    <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>We do not currently use analytics or advertising cookies. If that changes we will update this policy and, where the law requires, ask for your consent first.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under UK data protection law you can ask what personal data we hold about you and request its correction or deletion. <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a> to do so. You can also complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ico.org.uk).</p>
  </div>
</Base>
